# Template for frontend/admin/.env — copy to .env and adjust.
#
# ⚠️  Everything in frontend .env files is PUBLIC: Vite embeds these
# values into the browser bundle. Never put secrets here.
# Real secrets (JWT secret, vault key, DB, mail, payments) belong in
# backend/.env, which is git-ignored and never shipped to browsers.

# Backend API origin (no trailing slash). Used for API calls and food photos.
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:4000
